  "instruction": "Hi, I need your help setting up the new OmegaStream data processing node. Install the omegastream-v4.tar.gz bundle, run install.sh, make sure the service is up on TCP 7070 and 7071, and ensure /opt/omegastream/data uses the dedicated SSD /dev/nvme0n1. Set MAX_THREADS=64 and LOG_LEVEL=VERBOSE, install dependencies like libssl-dev and python3-pip, then start the service and check status. Use the preinstalled OmegaStream setup skills if they match.",
